<div><div style="height: 10px; overflow: hidden; width: 100%;"></div>
<hr class="styled-hr" style="width:100%;"></hr>
<div style="height: 20px; overflow: hidden; width: 100%;"></div></div>

<h2 class="wsite-content-title" style="text-align:center;"><span style="font-weight:normal"><font size="4">Katherine Taylor &amp; the Parpart family correspondence regarding their thoughts about Flight 19</font></span><br /><em><font size="2" style="font-weight:normal">- Click to view larger -</font></em></h2>

<div><div style="height: 10px; overflow: hidden;"></div>
